<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Reset your staff password
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Staff security
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We received a request to reset the staff password for <strong>{{email}}</strong>. Use the verification code below to set a new password.
</p>

{{> code-box label="Your reset code" value=token}}

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  This code expires in <strong>{{expiresInSeconds}} seconds</strong>. Enter it in the staff portal to continue.
</p>

{{#> tip title="Didn't request this?"}}
  If you did not request a password reset, contact a Dukka administrator immediately. Do not share this code with anyone.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Keeping staff access secure protects every market we serve.
</p>
